<title>JAPAN: Moody's changes Sumitomo Bank's ratings outlook.</title>
<headline>Moody's changes Sumitomo Bank's ratings outlook.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Thursday that it had changed the ratings outlook for Sumitomo Bank Ltd to stable from positive.  </p>
<p>Although the bank's asset quality appears to be somewhat superior to that of other banks in its rating category, the ongoing decline in Japanese real estate values continues to restrain improvements in the bank's profitability, Moody's said in a statement.</p>
</text>
